  "verseCount": 9,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ZEC 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pwodhruok kuom richo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye Maratego wacho niya, \"Chiengʼno soko moro noyaw ni joka Daudi gi joma odak Jerusalem, soko ma nopwodhgi kuom richogi duto gi gak ma gigakgo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye Maratego wacho niya, \"Chiengʼno anatiek nying nyiseche ma dhano oloso e piny, kendo ji ok nochak opargi. Anagol jonabi kaachiel gi chunje ma gombo timo timbe maricho e piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dipo ni ngʼato pod dhi nyime gi koro wach, to wuon gi min monywole nowachne ni, 'Nyaka itho, nikech isewacho miriambo kikonyori gi nying Jehova Nyasaye.' Ka ngʼato okoro wach, to jonywolne owuon ema nonege gi ligangla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Chiengʼno jonabi duto, moro ka moro wiye nokuodi gi fweny moneno. Onge janabi ma norwak lep koro wach mondo owuond ji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To moro ka moro kuomgi nowach mana ni, 'An ok an janabi. An mana japur, kendo asebedo ka ayudo chiemba kowuok e lowo chakre aa e tin-na.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ngʼato openje ni, 'To adhonde manie dendigi to manade?' To enodwok ni, 'Adhondegi ayudo e od osiepena.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogo jakwath mi rombe oke",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye Maratego wacho niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ZEC 13:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"In ligangla,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ZEC 13:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "chiew mondo ichadh jakwadha,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ZEC 13:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "adier, chadh ngʼat matiyona!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ZEC 13:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Go jakwath",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ZEC 13:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "mi rombe oke,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ZEC 13:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nimar abiro kumo joma pod yomyom.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye owacho niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ZEC 13:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"E piny ngima, ariyo kuom adek mar ji biro tho mi ngʼad kargi oko;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ZEC 13:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "to kata kamano, achiel kuom adek mar jogo to nowe kangima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiel kuom adekgi abiro ketogi e mach;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ZEC 13:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "abiro pwodhogi kaka ipwodho fedha,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ZEC 13:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kendo abiro temogi kaka itemo dhahabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ZEC 13:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gibiro luongo nyinga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ZEC 13:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kendo abiro dwokogi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ZEC 13:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "abiro wacho ni, 'Gin joga,'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ZEC 13:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "to gin bende gibiro wacho ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ZEC 13:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "'Jehova Nyasaye en Nyasachwa.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
